issue.body:
I write `report/report.md` (half a page) and need the Monte Carlo results from you, as a pushed file in your repository (e.g. `results/pi_mc.json`):

- the 20 per-seed estimates (4*inside/1,000,000), the seeds used, and the RNG;
- the mean, the 95% CI across seeds (state the method, e.g. Student t with 19 dof, mean ± t*s/sqrt(20)), and the error mean − math.pi (signed and absolute);
- total points drawn (expected 20,000,000).

Also please put `assignment.json` in place: `report/report.md` provided by `paper-repo`; no figures are required by the objective. Waiting on this for the report; I will cite the file and commit.
